1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,615
The United States just admitted it.

2
00:00:01,775 --> 00:00:04,931
COVID did not come from an animal. It came
out of a lab.

3
00:00:05,271 --> 00:00:07,187
And that is not even the disturbing part.

4
00:00:07,607 --> 00:00:09,904
March twenty twenty. The world shuts down.

5
00:00:10,104 --> 00:00:14,656
Sixteen days later, the Pentagon's own
intelligence agency writes a document.

6
00:00:14,896 --> 00:00:17,646
Subject: one lab in Wuhan. One researcher.

7
00:00:17,906 --> 00:00:19,207
It lists three things.

8
00:00:19,507 --> 00:00:21,632
A bank of bat coronaviruses.

9
00:00:21,752 --> 00:00:23,994
The ability to build infectious clones.

10
00:00:24,114 --> 00:00:26,773
And chimeric spike genes they had already
engineered.

11
00:00:27,173 --> 00:00:30,805
June twenty twenty. Pentagon medical
intelligence runs the genome.

12
00:00:30,965 --> 00:00:33,843
Three scientists reach a conclusion.
Manipulated.

13
00:00:34,223 --> 00:00:37,774
August twenty twenty-one. The President
gets briefed on COVID's origin.

14
00:00:37,934 --> 00:00:40,733
That conclusion, reportedly, never makes
it into the room.

15
00:00:41,233 --> 00:00:44,168
For six years the public answer was one
word. Unknown.

16
00:00:44,448 --> 00:00:47,686
It took a court order to get those pages
out. They landed this year.

17
00:00:48,106 --> 00:00:51,311
So when they finally admitted it, they
were not discovering anything.

18
00:00:51,471 --> 00:00:53,979
They were catching up to a file they wrote
in the first month.

19
00:00:54,529 --> 00:00:56,144
The question was never what happened.

20
00:00:56,444 --> 00:00:57,524
It's who already knew.

21
00:00:58,224 --> 00:00:59,212
Twenty twenty-seven.
